  <metadata>
    <name>Vusanje – Zla Kolata</name>
    <desc>The Zla Kolata trail is 9.6 km long and runs in one direction, with a total ascent of 1340 m and a descent of 418 m. The estimated walking time without breaks is 6 h 30 min, and the trail is located in Prokletije National Park. Route data © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright). Elevation produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA; all rights reserved.</desc>
